{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49489","headline":"河传 一 · 顾敻","name":"河传 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕扬，晴景。\n小窗屏暖，鸳鸯交颈。\n菱花掩却翠鬟欹，慵整，海棠帘外影。\n绣帏香断金鸂鶒，无消息。\n心事空相忆，倚东风。\n春正浓，愁红，泪痕衣上重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}